WEBVTT

00:20.640 --> 00:22.680
[solemn music]

00:37.560 --> 00:41.000
[Nanno] It's finally graduation day.

00:42.600 --> 00:44.400
Everyone is sad about leaving

00:44.480 --> 00:46.920
as if everything in their life
is about to end

00:48.920 --> 00:51.800
and they're not ready to start
the next phase of their life.

01:00.040 --> 01:05.519
Many believe that after this,
everything will become part of the past.

01:05.600 --> 01:09.480
We don't ever want to forget
all those great memories we made.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.240
However, this might not be the end,

01:15.320 --> 01:17.880
but just the beginning,

01:17.960 --> 01:22.760
when all the ugly truths from our past
will be on earth.

01:23.600 --> 01:24.600
So, be careful.

01:25.160 --> 01:30.040
The past is not as beautiful
as you remember.

01:32.760 --> 01:35.000
[suspenseful music]

01:46.320 --> 01:48.520
[theme music]

02:57.680 --> 02:59.080
GRADE 12-1 HOMECOMING, 12TH ANNIVERSARY
SAKNUSORN 114TH ALUMNI

02:59.160 --> 03:01.160
[Wit] Good evening, everybody.

03:01.240 --> 03:05.440
Let me hear a round of applause
for Saknusorn 114th Alumni.

03:05.520 --> 03:07.120
GRADE 12-1 HOMECOMING
SAKNUSORN 114TH ALUMNI

03:07.200 --> 03:08.200
TILL DEATH DO US APART

03:08.280 --> 03:09.280
Amazing.

03:09.360 --> 03:13.760
The sound of the applause was so loud,
even people in Laos could hear it.

03:13.840 --> 03:17.120
But for those who are thirsty,
get over here.

03:17.200 --> 03:19.640
For those who are hungry, go over there.

03:19.720 --> 03:21.320
No point in holding back.

03:21.400 --> 03:24.160
Let's do this. Yeah!

03:24.240 --> 03:27.520
[crowd cheering]

03:27.600 --> 03:28.600
Yeah.

03:29.800 --> 03:32.040
[laughs]
What's wrong with you, guys?

03:32.120 --> 03:33.960
-[coughs]
-What the hell?

03:34.040 --> 03:36.440
I spilled my drink because of you, jerk.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.120
Oh, Thap, you dick.

03:38.200 --> 03:40.520
-Fong. You asshole.
-Good evening, ma'am.

03:40.600 --> 03:41.520
Hello there.

03:41.600 --> 03:43.160
What, you called her an asshole, huh?

03:43.240 --> 03:45.720
What's that? Who would dare
to call an angel such a foul name?

03:45.800 --> 03:46.640
Not me.

03:47.120 --> 03:49.400
Wait. You guys still don't have
the class shirts?

03:49.480 --> 03:50.880
-That's true.
-I'll get them for you.

03:50.960 --> 03:52.920
Wait, Meng, don't. I'll do it.

03:53.000 --> 03:56.560
Oh. Oh… There he goes, just like that.

03:56.640 --> 03:59.000
Fong! I haven't seen you
in a long time. I missed you.

03:59.080 --> 04:01.680
-Hey.
-[girls giggling]

04:01.760 --> 04:03.760
-How are you?
-Yeah, girl.

04:03.840 --> 04:04.680
Are you dating now?

04:04.760 --> 04:06.320
What about you? Are you happy?

04:06.840 --> 04:08.320
Yeah, how are you?

04:08.800 --> 04:12.440
-Have you made up with May?
-No. She's got someone new.

04:12.520 --> 04:13.520
She got him here tonight.

04:14.240 --> 04:15.480
[Nanno] Do you want something to drink?

04:15.560 --> 04:17.200
Wow, thank you.

04:17.880 --> 04:19.240
[Meng] Here. For Fong as well.

04:21.440 --> 04:22.360
[Meng] Thanks.

04:22.840 --> 04:23.960
Hey, are you…

04:24.040 --> 04:24.960
[Nanno] Yeah?

04:26.800 --> 04:27.880
Uhm…

04:33.520 --> 04:35.800
Hey, you like teens now?

04:36.360 --> 04:37.680
No, I don't.

04:37.760 --> 04:38.720
Yes, you do. Yes, you do.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.240
-You wolf.
-It's not like that all.

04:40.320 --> 04:42.200
-How come?
-I just have this feeling…

04:42.280 --> 04:43.280
This feeling, what?

04:44.160 --> 04:45.360
She seems familiar.

04:45.440 --> 04:47.760
Oh, I see. Familiar, huh?

04:47.840 --> 04:49.920
-Yes. That's right.
-Was that the restaurant?

04:50.000 --> 04:51.280
-Yes.
-Fong, here.

04:52.200 --> 04:54.920
[Bell] Hey. What's that? Orange juice.

04:55.000 --> 04:59.080
Well, I quit drinking for a while,
but I can still have a toast with you.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.640
-Right?
-Come on.

05:00.720 --> 05:02.120
[all] Cheers.

05:02.200 --> 05:03.080
[glasses clink]

05:04.280 --> 05:07.240
[Wit] Oh, jeez! Look who's here.
Thap and Fong.

05:07.320 --> 05:08.720
-What the…
-The "it" couple.

05:08.800 --> 05:10.800
Was I just asking about them, huh?

05:10.880 --> 05:12.640
They're standing right over there.

05:12.720 --> 05:15.520
Okay, let's do it like this. I get it.

05:15.600 --> 05:18.120
I don't want to talk too much.

05:18.200 --> 05:19.840
Let the photos speak for themselves.

05:19.920 --> 05:21.240
Okay, show them.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.560
Here. How is it? Look.

05:23.640 --> 05:26.080
Two straight faces. This means…

05:26.160 --> 05:27.720
They're in love with each other.
[laughs]

05:27.800 --> 05:29.840
[Wit] And here, holding a guitar.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.520
Normally, he would play rock music.

05:31.600 --> 05:33.080
But once he saw Fong clapping for him,

05:33.160 --> 05:35.440
he would only play love songs. Ha-ha!

05:35.520 --> 05:37.320
Wow, look at him go.

05:37.400 --> 05:39.960
Damn! Very cheesy.

05:40.040 --> 05:44.040
Look at him holding her shoulder,
showing ownership.

05:44.680 --> 05:45.800
[Wit] He's possessive.

05:45.880 --> 05:48.120
Captain Thap is possessive.

05:48.200 --> 05:51.800
As of now, our Fong has quit
her promising sales job,

05:51.880 --> 05:54.960
and is taking care of Captain Thap 24/7.

05:55.040 --> 05:57.040
The moment I knew that,

05:57.120 --> 05:58.920
I was so jealous that I cried my eyes out.

05:59.000 --> 06:01.280
Okay, everybody. Raise your glasses.

06:01.360 --> 06:03.600
[Wit] We'll give Thap and Fong
our blessing.

06:03.680 --> 06:08.840
To the iconic couple, Thap and Fong!

06:08.920 --> 06:11.160
[all] Cheers!
[giggling]

06:30.800 --> 06:32.960
[upbeat music playing]

06:37.200 --> 06:39.000
[Proud] You can't compare me with Thap,

06:39.080 --> 06:41.440
because being a flight attendant
is so much more difficult.

06:41.520 --> 06:44.600
I have to take care of the guests,
serve them whatever they want,

06:44.680 --> 06:46.760
meanwhile, I have
to watch out for perverts.

06:46.840 --> 06:49.560
PROUD
FLIGHT ATTENDANT

06:49.640 --> 06:51.320
EX-DRUM MAJOR
3.0 GPA

06:51.400 --> 06:54.400
Do you want to sell cosmetics with me?
My job is really, really easy.

06:54.480 --> 06:56.000
You just have to stir
the cream really well,

06:56.080 --> 06:58.480
give it some pretty packaging,
and then, sell it.

06:58.560 --> 07:00.600
Anyone who's free can join me.
It's really fun.

07:00.680 --> 07:05.160
BELL
OWNER OF SKIN CARE COMPANY

07:05.240 --> 07:07.360
EX-CHEERLEADER
2.8 GPA

07:07.440 --> 07:11.640
Wow, oh, my god. The reunion
of the Angel Gang is in progress.

07:11.720 --> 07:15.320
WIT
ENERGY ENGINEER

07:15.400 --> 07:18.440
PRESIDENT OF SAKNUSORN 114TH
3.2 GPA

07:18.520 --> 07:19.400
Come on, now.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.640
-Get your glasses in here.
-[glasses clink]

07:20.720 --> 07:21.640
Don't you remember?

07:21.720 --> 07:24.400
You locked me in the bathroom,
and I missed the test.

07:24.480 --> 07:26.120
Of course I do. That was the best.

07:26.200 --> 07:28.720
MENG
FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER

07:28.800 --> 07:31.280
SCHOOL PHOTOGRAPHER
2.5 GPA

07:31.360 --> 07:34.320
I remember thinking I needed
to fuck myself up.

07:34.880 --> 07:36.120
Yeah, look at me now.

07:36.200 --> 07:38.560
CHAI
COMPETITIVE BODYBUILDER

07:38.640 --> 07:40.600
THE CLASS WEAKLING
2.0 GPA

07:40.680 --> 07:41.720
[Meng] Fuck you. My head--

07:41.800 --> 07:43.480
You guys still haven't stopped fighting?

07:43.560 --> 07:45.200
-Hey.
-Yeah.

07:45.280 --> 07:46.240
-Hi, Kai.
-Doctor Kai.

07:46.320 --> 07:48.840
DOCTOR KAI
HOSPITAL OWNER

07:48.920 --> 07:51.480
SINGLE
4.0 GPA SINCE KINDERGARTEN

07:51.560 --> 07:53.320
-I'm all in.
-[Shorty] Oh, you guys are here?

07:53.400 --> 07:54.800
[Chai] Yeah, we're here.

07:54.880 --> 07:56.000
-[Meng] Shorty.
-Cheers!

07:56.080 --> 07:58.240
SHORTY
CONTRACTOR

07:58.320 --> 08:00.080
ONE WIFE AND ONE KID

08:00.160 --> 08:01.040
[Meng] Cheers!

08:06.000 --> 08:08.720
-You guys are so slow.
-I can't.

08:08.800 --> 08:11.400
Do you all remember
if our class had 30 or 31 people?

08:11.480 --> 08:13.160
I was arguing with Wit earlier.

08:13.800 --> 08:15.640
-[Wit] Shorty, what the hell?
-[Shorty] Are you serious?

08:15.720 --> 08:17.680
-Man, are you drunk already?
-Yeah, probably.

08:17.760 --> 08:20.280
-I'm not drunk.
-Keep talking. Count carefully.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.600
-Wit, come on.
-Was it 30?

08:21.680 --> 08:24.080
-[Wit] Talk to me when you're done.
-You were the class president.

08:24.160 --> 08:25.840
How can you forget
your friend so easily, huh?

08:25.920 --> 08:27.640
-He's getting serious all of a sudden.
-[Meng] Oh, there he is.

08:28.480 --> 08:29.880
-[Chai] Come on.
-[Wit] He's always like this.

08:29.960 --> 08:31.200
-Watch out!
-Oh.

08:31.960 --> 08:33.880
-I'm sorry.
-Sorry.

08:35.679 --> 08:36.760
What's your name?

08:37.600 --> 08:39.320
Why don't you think about it?

08:44.520 --> 08:45.600
[Proud] Almost drunk.

08:49.680 --> 08:51.200
[Shorty] We should toast.

08:51.280 --> 08:53.240
[all cheering]

08:53.320 --> 08:55.240
-Cheers!
-[Kai] You finally got laid!

08:55.320 --> 08:56.840
[Wit] I'm happy for your family, Shorty.

08:56.920 --> 08:58.200
-[Meng laughs]
-[Shorty] Fuck you.

08:58.280 --> 08:59.880
[Wit] No, you got fucked.

09:01.360 --> 09:02.840
[Shorty] Hello, everyone.

09:03.840 --> 09:08.320
We're now at the spot where we buried
our time capsule 12 years ago.

09:08.400 --> 09:10.800
We've been digging for a while,

09:10.880 --> 09:13.880
but we still haven't found the chest.

09:18.840 --> 09:21.040
[Shorty] Hey. Hey, what's that smell?

09:21.120 --> 09:22.400
[Meng] That really stinks.

09:22.480 --> 09:25.000
-[Meng] Whoa, there are worms.
-[Shorty] Holy shit! Worms.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.680
[Bell] Gross.

09:26.760 --> 09:28.760
-Shit, come on. Hurry. Let's get it…
-So many worms.

09:29.440 --> 09:31.120
-[Meng grunts]
-[Shorty] Shit.

09:31.200 --> 09:32.840
-[Meng] I got it.
-Come here.

09:33.360 --> 09:35.360
-Hey, friends.
-Yes.

09:35.440 --> 09:39.120
Right now, we've got the time capsule box
that we buried 12 years ago.

09:39.200 --> 09:40.200
-Yeah.
-Come on.

09:40.280 --> 09:41.520
[Meng] It's so fucking exhausting.

09:41.600 --> 09:44.680
Right now, we're going to carry this chest
into the reunion and open it.

09:44.760 --> 09:49.120
[crowd applauding]

09:49.640 --> 09:51.080
[Bell] What? Oh, my god.

09:51.160 --> 09:53.360
[Shorty] Wit, you're such a jerk.
You should've helped.

09:54.120 --> 09:56.080
Why didn't you come and help, asshole?

09:56.160 --> 09:57.600
-[Chai] Meng, did you step on shit?
-[Meng] Wit, open it.

09:57.680 --> 09:59.400
-[Meng] Ew.
-[Wit clears throat]

09:59.480 --> 10:00.520
[Proud] Just open it.

10:01.640 --> 10:03.920
[Shorty] Just do it.
Come on, let's open it.

10:04.000 --> 10:04.840
[Wit] This key…

10:04.920 --> 10:09.640
I've been keeping it safe
for 12 years now. Twelve long years.

10:09.720 --> 10:11.080
Judging from your faces…

10:11.640 --> 10:13.000
I should open it right away, huh?

10:13.080 --> 10:14.640
-[Meng] Yeah, just open it.
-[all] Yeah.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.640
[Wit] I just wanted it to be a bit
ceremonial.

10:16.720 --> 10:18.680
-[Shorty] Hurry up.
-[Bell giggles]

10:26.480 --> 10:27.400
[Wit] Shit!

10:27.480 --> 10:29.320
-[Shorty] What the fuck?
-[Chai] What is it?

10:29.400 --> 10:30.560
It's so rusted.

10:31.680 --> 10:33.040
-[Chai] Hurry up.
-[Shorty] Smash it.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.320
-[Wit] Smash?
-[Shorty] Yeah.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.320
Just smash it.

10:35.400 --> 10:36.720
Chai, come here and do it.

10:36.800 --> 10:38.800
Jeez, don't just stand there
flexing your muscles.

10:38.880 --> 10:40.080
-All right.
-I'll handle it.

10:41.240 --> 10:42.240
[Meng] Hey.

10:42.320 --> 10:46.200
[people cheering, applauding]

10:47.000 --> 10:49.720
-[Wit] That's my man. Good job, Chai.
-[Chai] You got it.

10:50.960 --> 10:51.840
[Wit groans]

10:51.920 --> 10:53.160
-[Meng] Oh, shit.
-[booing]

10:54.280 --> 10:55.640
[people coughing]

10:57.240 --> 10:58.160
[Kai] It's not worth it.

10:59.080 --> 11:01.040
[crowd] Ooh.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.280
Look. Check this out. Guess whose it is.

11:03.800 --> 11:05.200
Oh, it's mine.
[chuckles]

11:05.280 --> 11:06.320
[Bell] It's so old.

11:06.400 --> 11:10.920
Thank you so much, everyone,
for signing this flag

11:11.000 --> 11:12.600
and being here tonight.

11:13.560 --> 11:15.720
I'm really grateful for you.

11:16.320 --> 11:17.960
[Kai and Meng] Yeah.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.840
-[Shorty] Cool.
-[Wit] Yeah! [chuckles]

11:21.520 --> 11:24.880
[camera shutter clicks]

11:28.280 --> 11:29.680
BODYBUILDING

11:29.760 --> 11:33.320
[camera shutter clicks faster]

11:35.920 --> 11:36.960
Hey.

11:37.040 --> 11:38.560
I don't even have to say who buried this.

11:38.640 --> 11:41.040
They even buried their letters together.

11:41.120 --> 11:43.160
That's so gross. Am I right, folks?

11:43.240 --> 11:44.120
[Meng] Yeah.

11:44.200 --> 11:47.160
All right, I'm going to need
Thap and Fong to come up,

11:47.240 --> 11:49.000
and read their love letters for us, okay?

11:49.080 --> 11:51.120
[crowd applauding]

11:51.200 --> 11:53.080
[Thap] Wait. Hold on.
That's private stuff.

11:53.560 --> 11:55.080
[Wit] Come on. We're all friends here.

11:55.160 --> 11:57.000
-[Shorty] Yeah.
-[Wit] Hurry. Come here.

11:57.080 --> 11:57.920
-[Shorty] Open it.
-[Meng] Yeah.

11:58.000 --> 11:58.920
-[Meng] Come on.
-[Kai] Hurry up.

11:59.000 --> 12:00.240
-[Kai] Let's go.
-[Wit] Read them.

12:00.320 --> 12:03.640
[all] Read them! Read them! Read them!

12:03.720 --> 12:05.960
[Thap] All right. Okay. Fuck you.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.840
[Wit] Yeah. No need to be nervous.
We're all friends.

12:09.920 --> 12:11.360
-[Meng] Yeah.
-[Wit] Are you thirsty?

12:13.000 --> 12:15.680
[Wit] It seems like he's thirsty.
Hey, you. Get him a drink.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.160
[Wit] Okay, here you go, Captain.

12:29.160 --> 12:30.160
[Wit] Thank you.

12:31.720 --> 12:33.400
[Wit] Read it already. People are waiting.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.400
Oh, okay.

12:34.480 --> 12:35.360
Yeah.

12:39.520 --> 12:42.600
"I promise I won't ever leave you, Fong.

12:44.520 --> 12:46.000
Once I become a pilot,

12:47.080 --> 12:48.560
will you please marry me?"

12:51.480 --> 12:54.120
[crowd] Ooh!

12:54.200 --> 12:55.400
[Bell] Not bad at all.

12:56.520 --> 12:57.880
Okay, I'm done.

12:57.960 --> 12:58.960
-Is that it?
-That's it.

12:59.040 --> 13:00.200
Okay, applause.

13:00.280 --> 13:02.440
[crowd applauding]

13:02.520 --> 13:03.880
Very nice. Very nice.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.240
[Thap] Fong, what's wrong?

13:09.080 --> 13:10.120
You seem quiet.

13:13.800 --> 13:15.320
We can go home first if you want.

13:18.040 --> 13:20.200
[Thap] I don't want our friends
to see us like this.

13:22.360 --> 13:23.800
About the party…

13:25.440 --> 13:26.840
There's no need to worry.

13:28.280 --> 13:30.000
[Thap] You've been like this
for almost a week.

13:31.280 --> 13:32.720
Tell me what you're thinking.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.440
What about you?

13:37.200 --> 13:38.840
Is there something you wanna tell me?

13:41.200 --> 13:42.800
Fong, what do you want me to say?

13:43.960 --> 13:44.960
I don't know.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.320
I'm a woman.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.160
I have a gut feeling.

13:51.680 --> 13:52.720
[Thap] About what?

13:54.640 --> 13:55.760
What did I do?

13:57.120 --> 13:59.400
Don't let me catch you
red-handed, pathetic.

14:01.120 --> 14:03.080
How many times have we talked about this?

14:03.600 --> 14:05.760
Yes, Thap. How many?

14:05.840 --> 14:07.240
Just ask yourself.

14:12.200 --> 14:13.400
[sighs]

14:34.560 --> 14:38.480
Okay. Captain Thap
has read his letter for us.

14:38.560 --> 14:39.560
Now…

14:40.160 --> 14:41.720
In order to make it fair,

14:41.800 --> 14:44.760
-our angelic Fong has to read hers, too.
-[crowd cheering]

14:46.040 --> 14:47.320
What's the sticker on the cover?

14:47.800 --> 14:50.520
"Together, we live.
Leave me, you're dead."

14:50.600 --> 14:52.400
-[Wit] Wow.
-[crowd] Ooh!

14:52.480 --> 14:53.560
[Chai] Hey.

14:56.800 --> 14:58.200
Let Thap read it to everyone.

15:02.600 --> 15:04.080
-[Fong] Here.
-Okay.

15:06.520 --> 15:07.600
"My dearest Thap.

15:09.800 --> 15:13.040
I don't know how long it will take
until you read this letter.

15:15.320 --> 15:18.400
I just want to thank you
for taking care of me,

15:20.520 --> 15:24.480
and for always
forgiving me when I'm wrong.

15:36.000 --> 15:39.120
[Thap] I just want to tell you that

15:40.000 --> 15:43.520
if I didn't have you,
I don't know how my life would be,

15:45.080 --> 15:46.680
and I don't want to know.

15:48.640 --> 15:52.440
So, I've decided
to have you here with me forever,

15:54.040 --> 15:55.840
and I'll do my best to take care of you.

15:57.240 --> 15:59.040
I won't ever let you go.

16:03.000 --> 16:07.600
PS. The sticker on the front,
I mean it with all my heart.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.600
-[Wit] Damn.
-[Shorty] Wow, shit.

16:11.680 --> 16:14.080
[crowd applauding]

16:14.160 --> 16:15.000
Amazing.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.040
-Here.
-Take it.

16:16.120 --> 16:20.760
[Wit] Go join the others. Go stand there.
Yeah, go. Hey.

16:21.520 --> 16:23.440
Who belongs to this phone?

16:23.520 --> 16:26.840
Who hasn't come to claim
this amazing cellular phone?

16:26.920 --> 16:30.320
[Wit] I heard that this model
is really tough and durable.

16:31.000 --> 16:32.840
Come on, anyone. Whose is it? Anyone?

16:34.720 --> 16:36.480
Where did this phone come from?

16:37.960 --> 16:41.000
[Shorty] I told you, Wit. I knew it.

16:41.080 --> 16:43.440
Our class had 31 people, not 30.

16:44.000 --> 16:47.400
Well, fuck you, Shorty. Think about it.
Who has this phone?

16:49.120 --> 16:51.760
I'm starting to remember
that our class had 31 people.

16:52.960 --> 16:54.680
Shit, but I just can't remember
who that be.

17:01.280 --> 17:03.440
It was Nan… something.

17:03.520 --> 17:06.040
She came in the tenth grade,
and left after less than a semester.

17:10.560 --> 17:12.240
Nanno, the psycho.

17:12.319 --> 17:14.599
GRADE 10-1

17:16.599 --> 17:17.680
[teacher] Draw the line first.

17:32.680 --> 17:33.720
Hello there.

17:34.560 --> 17:35.880
My name is Nanno.

17:36.360 --> 17:37.680
I'm 16.

17:38.600 --> 17:40.040
Today is my first day.

17:40.520 --> 17:41.840
Please be kind.

17:51.960 --> 17:53.600
[inaudible]

18:03.280 --> 18:04.440
[Fong] From what I remember,

18:04.520 --> 18:06.800
Nanno enrolled
in the middle of the semester,

18:06.880 --> 18:08.560
so she didn't have many friends.

18:08.640 --> 18:10.320
[giggles]
Yes.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.000
[Fong] We tried to hang out with her,

18:12.080 --> 18:15.680
but she was always on the phone,
with her boyfriend.

18:18.920 --> 18:20.760
[light chuckle]
Yes, Tan, yeah.

18:21.320 --> 18:22.160
Yeah.

18:23.680 --> 18:25.800
See you then. I love you too.

18:26.560 --> 18:27.440
Yeah.

18:30.160 --> 18:32.640
-Nanno, you wanna get ice cream with us?
-Mm.

18:32.720 --> 18:35.680
There's a new shop in front of the school.
You wanna come?

18:37.200 --> 18:40.240
I'm sorry. I already have plans.

18:40.320 --> 18:42.400
[Bell] With your boyfriend, right?

18:42.480 --> 18:44.600
You're always talking to your boyfriend.

18:44.680 --> 18:47.320
I mean, don't you want to spend
some time with your friends?

18:50.320 --> 18:52.320
Okay, that's all right.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.640
Next time then.

18:53.720 --> 18:55.880
Maybe you can even bring
your boyfriend with you.

18:55.960 --> 18:57.600
-Yes.
-[Nanno] Okay.

18:58.160 --> 19:00.040
So, next time, then.

19:10.320 --> 19:12.520
[female student] Happy Valentine's Day.

19:18.520 --> 19:20.600
-[Kai] Jerks, don't put these on me.
-[Meng] Whose are they for?

19:20.680 --> 19:22.200
-[Kai] Hey, you.
-[Meng] Whose are these?

19:22.840 --> 19:25.200
-[Kai] I said no.
-[Meng] You're going down.

19:25.280 --> 19:26.920
-[Meng] Let's try it.
-[Kai] Hey, don't put it on me.

19:27.000 --> 19:27.880
[laughing]

19:29.120 --> 19:31.960
[boys cheering]

19:32.600 --> 19:34.640
-[Meng] What the heck are you doing?
-[Kai] Okay, okay.

19:35.520 --> 19:36.720
[Kai] Here you go.

19:36.800 --> 19:39.280
[Meng] I can't believe you did that.

19:39.360 --> 19:40.600
[girls] Aw.

19:40.680 --> 19:41.600
[Meng] This is for you?

19:43.000 --> 19:44.840
[Fong] You can have some of that.

19:47.680 --> 19:49.000
[Nanno] Those are pretty.

19:49.560 --> 19:50.760
Hey.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.640
[Proud] Let's see.

19:56.240 --> 19:59.640
[Bell] "Happy Valentine's Day. From Thap."

19:59.720 --> 20:01.920
Wow, this came with the roses?

20:02.000 --> 20:03.920
You guys are disgusting.

20:04.000 --> 20:07.560
[Bell] That's true. But this bouquet is
small, so he must not love you that much.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.600
[Proud] Yeah.

20:10.480 --> 20:12.640
But Thap is quite biased, you know?

20:13.200 --> 20:15.200
He only gives flowers to his girlfriend.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.680
[Proud] I'm jealous. I want flowers, too.

20:20.760 --> 20:24.200
Come on, let me put these stickers on you.
Someone will give you roses, too.

20:24.280 --> 20:25.920
[Proud] She's blushing.
[giggles]

20:28.960 --> 20:29.800
Here.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.120
[delivery man] Is there a Nanno?

20:32.040 --> 20:33.440
-[Nanno] Yes?
-Flower delivery.

20:34.520 --> 20:36.200
-Oh, my god.
-Amazing.

20:36.280 --> 20:37.720
Oh, wow.

20:38.280 --> 20:40.720
[Bell] It's so big.
Tan must love her very much.

20:40.800 --> 20:43.400
[Proud] That's gorgeous. That's so pretty.

20:43.960 --> 20:46.640
If he really loved me,
he'd give them to me himself.

20:46.720 --> 20:47.600
[Bell] There's a card.

20:47.680 --> 20:49.240
I HOPE YOU'RE HAPPY.
FORGIVE ME. SEE YOU.

20:49.320 --> 20:53.720
[Proud] They're the same.
I'm dying to see what Tan looks like.

20:53.800 --> 20:55.520
-[Proud] He must be really handsome.
-Yeah.

20:56.720 --> 20:58.040
And…

20:59.880 --> 21:01.080
In the card…

21:01.840 --> 21:04.480
What did Tan do to you
to make you so angry?

21:05.960 --> 21:07.120
It's nothing, really.

21:07.680 --> 21:09.320
He just doesn't have time.

21:09.400 --> 21:13.240
That's not a big deal.
You two are always on the phone together.

21:13.320 --> 21:16.280
So, stop being mad at him
and let us meet him already.

21:16.360 --> 21:17.880
-Yeah.
-Me too.

21:17.960 --> 21:20.600
Me too, I really wanna meet this guy.

21:20.680 --> 21:22.840
Your romantic Mr. Tan.

21:22.920 --> 21:25.480
When he has time, Nanno should tell him
to come hang out.

21:25.560 --> 21:28.160
-[Bell] Right.
-to finally meet this mystery man.

21:28.240 --> 21:29.960
I'll do my best, okay?

21:31.560 --> 21:33.320
And your roses are so pretty.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.480
[Proud and Bell] Yeah.

21:35.040 --> 21:36.280
Fong, you like them?

21:37.080 --> 21:38.160
You can have them.

21:40.120 --> 21:41.200
Hey.

21:41.280 --> 21:43.520
Tan didn't give them to me, did he?

21:43.600 --> 21:46.800
If you give these to someone else,
he'll be angry.

21:49.120 --> 21:50.800
If Fong doesn't want them…

21:51.680 --> 21:53.160
I'll just give them to someone else.

21:56.760 --> 21:57.840
Nanno.

22:17.280 --> 22:20.680
[Proud] Nanno promised
that she would let us meet Tan,

22:21.240 --> 22:23.720
but then the plan
would always be postponed

22:24.440 --> 22:27.120
by all those complicated reasons
she came up with.

22:27.880 --> 22:31.160
In the end, Fong just…

22:47.160 --> 22:48.840
Tan can't come here again?

22:50.000 --> 22:51.320
I had to wait for nothing again.

22:51.400 --> 22:54.840
Will I ever get to meet Tan
in this lifetime?

23:00.240 --> 23:01.280
I'm…

23:01.880 --> 23:03.920
gonna go to the restroom.

23:05.040 --> 23:06.280
Okay, yeah.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.480
Do you think…

23:13.200 --> 23:16.240
that Tan even exist at all?

23:16.320 --> 23:19.000
I agree that something is super fishy.

23:19.080 --> 23:19.960
Right?

23:20.480 --> 23:23.000
Who will keep missing plans
like this over and over?

23:23.080 --> 23:25.880
Do you think there's a reason
he doesn't want to meet us?

23:27.040 --> 23:30.080
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

23:32.280 --> 23:33.720
Should I look at her phone?

23:34.680 --> 23:35.880
Are you sure, Fong?

23:35.960 --> 23:36.960
Shut up.

23:37.040 --> 23:39.360
Go ahead. Take a look. I'm so curious.

23:40.360 --> 23:42.320
CONTACTS

23:43.360 --> 23:44.600
-What is it?
-Shit.

23:45.080 --> 23:47.000
-There's nothing here.
-What?

23:48.720 --> 23:50.040
Who is she talking to?

23:51.400 --> 23:53.280
-She was always on the phone.
-No incoming calls in here.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.280
No outgoing either.

24:02.760 --> 24:04.240
Do you wanna go for ice cream now?

24:08.200 --> 24:11.480
Tan is too busy, but I can go.

24:11.560 --> 24:13.440
[suspenseful music playing]

24:21.880 --> 24:24.640
Is there something wrong?
Why are you acting so weird?

24:25.720 --> 24:27.760
No. It's nothing.

24:29.640 --> 24:31.080
There's something we need to do.

24:33.840 --> 24:36.120
Oh, well. That's a shame.

24:37.600 --> 24:40.720
Let's go for some ice cream next time.
All of us, together.

24:40.800 --> 24:42.800
With or without Tan, okay?

24:45.360 --> 24:47.600
Yeah. Sure, Nanno.

24:48.480 --> 24:49.440
Yeah.

24:54.160 --> 24:55.640
Oh, Tan.

24:55.720 --> 24:56.840
[keypad beeping]

24:59.360 --> 25:00.400
[Nanno giggling]

25:01.200 --> 25:03.600
[Proud] Nanno who was always on her phone

25:03.680 --> 25:06.960
always chatting away,
was actually talking to…

25:08.960 --> 25:10.240
to no one.

25:11.280 --> 25:12.160
[Shorty] I see.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.280
I think I remember her now.

25:15.120 --> 25:16.040
And then what?

25:17.000 --> 25:18.040
Nothing changed.

25:18.560 --> 25:20.480
She was on her phone even more,

25:21.200 --> 25:23.200
because nobody would talk to her.

25:23.280 --> 25:26.160
[Nanno] Why? I don't get it. Why?

25:27.720 --> 25:28.680
What?

25:37.640 --> 25:38.760
[screaming]

25:39.280 --> 25:40.800
[suspenseful music playing]

26:55.920 --> 26:57.200
PSYCHO BITCH

26:57.280 --> 26:58.760
CRAZY BITCH TALKING TO NOTHING

26:58.840 --> 27:00.200
I'M CREEPED OUT WHEN I SEE YOU

27:00.280 --> 27:01.160
I FUCKING HATE NANNO

27:01.240 --> 27:02.120
FUCK OFF, BITCH

27:02.200 --> 27:03.840
TAN DOESN'T EXIST
GET THE FUCK OUT

27:18.360 --> 27:19.560
[Fong] And then one day,

27:20.200 --> 27:22.120
someone attacked her.

27:22.760 --> 27:24.240
She looked really awful.

27:30.040 --> 27:33.880
I remember that.
It was really bad. Blood everywhere.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.880
[Meng] And then what happened?

27:46.360 --> 27:47.280
I don't know.

27:47.960 --> 27:50.640
It seems like she disappeared
after that day.

27:51.600 --> 27:55.680
And here we are, we all forgot her
before we found that phone.

27:57.640 --> 27:59.600
Can anyone contact Nanno right now?

28:00.880 --> 28:02.760
-She's still our friend.
-How come?

28:02.840 --> 28:04.400
Are you going to cure her, Doctor Kai?

28:04.480 --> 28:05.800
I'm not a psychiatrist,

28:07.080 --> 28:09.760
but I still know something
that might be able to help.

28:11.840 --> 28:13.320
I wonder how she is right now.

28:15.800 --> 28:18.680
She's probably lying
in a mental hospital somewhere,

28:18.760 --> 28:19.680
being a psycho.

28:19.760 --> 28:21.040
[Shorty chuckles]

28:24.680 --> 28:25.680
Let me see it.

28:29.240 --> 28:31.160
This can't belong to Nanno.

28:31.680 --> 28:35.560
She left in tenth grade.
She wasn't there when we buried the chest.

28:38.240 --> 28:40.400
This is definitely Nanno's cell phone.

28:40.480 --> 28:41.680
I swear.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.560
MENU

28:46.640 --> 28:47.720
[Fong] What?

28:48.240 --> 28:49.600
-It turned on.
-[Shorty] What?

28:49.680 --> 28:50.520
[Chai] Really?

28:50.600 --> 28:52.560
-[Meng] It's been buried for 12 years.
-[Proud] What the fuck?

28:52.640 --> 28:54.880
-[Bell] True.
-Someone is definitely playing a prank.

28:59.360 --> 29:04.240
[phones ringing]

29:05.280 --> 29:06.240
[all] Shit.

29:09.880 --> 29:11.400
Wit, are you doing this…

29:12.800 --> 29:15.040
[phones continuously ringing]

29:15.120 --> 29:16.640
[static]
[Nanno] Hi, everyone.

29:19.240 --> 29:21.440
Do you remember who I am?

29:23.880 --> 29:24.920
I'm Nanno.

29:25.000 --> 29:26.560
Nanno, hey! It's Nanno.

29:26.640 --> 29:27.840
It's me, Nanno.

29:27.920 --> 29:30.080
Nanno, hey! It's Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:30.160 --> 29:32.880
Nanno, hey! It's Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.720
Nanno, hey! It's Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:34.800 --> 29:37.560
Nanno, hey! It's Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

29:37.640 --> 29:39.520
[echoing]

30:07.920 --> 30:09.040
[Thap] Nanno?

30:12.520 --> 30:13.840
You are Nanno, right?

30:16.240 --> 30:18.000
[Nanno] I thought you'd forgotten me.

30:19.080 --> 30:20.800
You remember Nanno now?

30:21.280 --> 30:22.360
Thap.

30:33.680 --> 30:35.280
You missed me, right?

30:37.080 --> 30:38.360
I'm back with my class.

30:47.960 --> 30:48.880
You…

30:49.480 --> 30:51.200
really are Nanno, aren't you?

30:51.880 --> 30:53.720
It's really only been a few years.

30:54.360 --> 30:56.080
Have you already forgotten my face?

30:56.840 --> 30:59.400
No, it's just that a lot has happened
when we last saw you,

30:59.920 --> 31:01.880
but you're still as beautiful as ever.

31:17.760 --> 31:20.320
Hmm. Now that I think about it,

31:20.880 --> 31:22.480
our whole class

31:23.640 --> 31:25.040
still looks the same.

31:26.960 --> 31:29.520
So what are you up to now?

31:30.080 --> 31:32.080
I'm still talking to no one
like I was before.

31:35.360 --> 31:38.000
But you're still so pretty.
You probably have settled down.

31:39.240 --> 31:41.280
Stop it, Meng. You're making me blush.

31:42.880 --> 31:48.200
But I can't compete
with all those pretty little girls.

31:56.360 --> 32:00.360
Did you know that
Meng, on top of being a photographer,

32:00.920 --> 32:02.160
is also a film maker?

32:17.040 --> 32:18.040
[Bell] What?

32:20.800 --> 32:23.120
-[Proud] What?
-[Wit] Shit.

32:30.640 --> 32:33.960
[Nanno] Wait, wait, wait.
Think of that as your trailer.

32:34.040 --> 32:36.960
If you guys want to see the full version,
feel free to download.

32:37.040 --> 32:39.040
It will probably take months
to watch them all.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.440
Meng, you pervert.

32:42.000 --> 32:45.080
Now, stop that.
Don't be mean to your friend.

32:45.560 --> 32:49.440
Chai has his own addiction.
Lots and lots of steroids.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.440
I heard you had to forfeit your medals.

32:55.480 --> 32:57.480
[Nanno] If your lawyers
hadn't covered it up,

32:57.560 --> 32:59.720
you'd be in a big, big trouble.

33:02.840 --> 33:04.280
So, Nanno, what do you want?

33:04.760 --> 33:09.600
I saw you're having a reunion,
and I didn't wanna come empty-handed.

33:09.680 --> 33:12.280
That's why I made you these gifts
as a surprise.

33:13.320 --> 33:14.720
[Nanno] Like this one.

33:18.160 --> 33:21.720
This building
looks pretty familiar, doesn't it?

33:23.120 --> 33:24.120
[Nanno] Wit.

33:24.200 --> 33:27.440
Your construction company built
this building, right?

33:27.520 --> 33:28.720
35-STOREY BUILDING COLLAPSED
CULPRIT IN CUSTODY

33:28.800 --> 33:32.960
So, why was someone else arrested
and not you, Wit?

33:34.320 --> 33:38.320
Hiring someone else
to go to jail for you isn't just immoral.

33:39.480 --> 33:41.520
If the police find out about that,

33:43.160 --> 33:45.440
[Nanno] Wit will face serious
consequences.

33:45.520 --> 33:47.160
I'll be honest.

33:48.600 --> 33:49.920
I'm worried.

33:50.000 --> 33:53.080
What do you want, Nanno?
Can we make a deal with you or something?

33:53.160 --> 33:54.720
Make a deal like what?

33:55.200 --> 33:58.520
Doctor Kai did with the politicians?

33:58.600 --> 34:03.880
With their money, he built them a hospital
specifically for money laundering.

34:04.440 --> 34:05.280
Cool, right?

34:05.360 --> 34:07.720
How does hospital with no patients

34:08.360 --> 34:11.159
end up with so much cash
running through its accounts?

34:11.239 --> 34:13.080
You think that makes you better than us?

34:13.159 --> 34:15.600
You're still a stupid bitch,
you know that?

34:16.400 --> 34:19.080
Hmm, don't be mean, Bell.

34:19.639 --> 34:23.159
I don't want
to sound superior, especially.

34:23.239 --> 34:24.639
Not with you.

34:25.440 --> 34:27.920
I don't have the guts to fight you.

34:28.000 --> 34:29.440
-Huh.
-[scoffs]

34:29.920 --> 34:32.920
I heard you're selling skin care products.

34:33.000 --> 34:34.560
They all sold out.

34:35.080 --> 34:37.719
The sales were so good
you opened another brand,

34:38.679 --> 34:40.080
selling fake cream.

34:40.159 --> 34:43.520
But when the customers reported you,
the products vanished.

34:43.600 --> 34:45.080
WARNING. FAKE.

34:45.159 --> 34:46.480
RUINED FACE. CHEAP BUT FAKE.

34:47.159 --> 34:49.840
Guys, don't listen to her. She's a psycho.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.560
Grab her cell phone. Stop her.

34:54.560 --> 34:56.199
-[Wit] Calm down.
-[Chai] Wit, what the hell?

34:56.719 --> 34:58.760
If we all know each other's secret

34:58.840 --> 35:02.240
and no one says anything,
it'll just end here, won't it?

35:17.440 --> 35:20.160
Let's see what you can do
without your phone, you bitch.

35:28.480 --> 35:29.880
Shorty.

35:31.000 --> 35:33.200
This violent behavior of yours…

35:33.800 --> 35:35.280
You still have it, don't you?

35:36.840 --> 35:38.320
No wonder.

35:38.400 --> 35:39.720
Your wife wants a divorce,

35:40.680 --> 35:43.120
and also wants full custody
of your daughter.

35:43.200 --> 35:45.520
I'm going to win the case.
Don't you worry.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.520
Hmm.

35:50.640 --> 35:52.280
Let me tell you the truth.

35:52.880 --> 35:54.760
You'll never win the case.

35:55.600 --> 35:57.120
And you're going to lose your daughter.

35:59.480 --> 36:04.480
Shorty's wife has learned her lesson,
since she decided to marry you.

36:10.080 --> 36:11.640
I'll move in with my mom.

36:13.960 --> 36:15.560
[Shorty's wife]
I'll take my daughter, too.

36:15.640 --> 36:18.280
Bitch, I already told you
you can't take her from me.

36:18.360 --> 36:21.160
-Huh?
-Daddy, don't hurt Mommy.

36:21.240 --> 36:22.360
[kid wails]

36:22.440 --> 36:24.720
You think you're perfect, don't you?

36:26.960 --> 36:29.520
The evidence speaks for itself once again.

36:31.040 --> 36:33.080
-[Wit] Shorty, what the fuck is that?
-[Kai] What's wrong with you?

36:33.800 --> 36:35.880
[Nanno] Hot-headed and abusive.

36:35.960 --> 36:37.600
What court would sympathize with you?

36:49.520 --> 36:50.640
[sighs]

36:52.240 --> 36:54.480
It's been a pleasure
getting to see you all

36:55.800 --> 36:58.040
grow up to have such rich lives.

36:58.800 --> 37:00.320
It makes me truly happy.

37:01.880 --> 37:03.560
[Nanno] Let's forget about the past.

37:03.640 --> 37:05.280
Everyone makes mistakes.

37:05.360 --> 37:08.240
And you know,
I'm everyone's favorite psycho.

37:09.240 --> 37:11.600
This is something we're gonna laugh about.

37:11.680 --> 37:15.040
Now, isn't that right?
[giggles]

37:15.600 --> 37:17.960
[Chai] What are you trying
to get out of this?

37:18.040 --> 37:19.640
[Kai] Yeah. Stop this now.

37:20.160 --> 37:21.760
[Proud] What do you want?

37:21.840 --> 37:24.360
[Bell] Money? Or do you want revenge?

37:25.320 --> 37:27.440
One person at a time.

37:27.520 --> 37:30.680
If you talk at the same time,
I won't be able to understand.

37:31.560 --> 37:33.000
But it's funny

37:33.080 --> 37:37.840
because when we were at school together,
not a single person wanted to talk to me.

37:38.320 --> 37:40.840
But right now, I'm not sure
I'm gonna be talking to you.

37:40.920 --> 37:42.920
[Fong] No one wants to talk
to you right now, either.

37:43.640 --> 37:45.440
Because you're a psycho bitch.

37:45.520 --> 37:47.560
Why don't you go and talk
to your imaginary boyfriend?

37:48.560 --> 37:50.280
You'll never be welcome here.

37:52.600 --> 37:53.760
Fong.

37:53.840 --> 37:56.360
Don't be like that. You're so mean.

37:57.360 --> 38:00.520
But that's okay. You know, I understand.

38:01.280 --> 38:05.480
Yes, Fong has depression.
You even have to take medication.

38:06.360 --> 38:08.360
Have you taken your meds today?

38:08.440 --> 38:10.560
-Fuck you.
-[Nanno] Hey.

38:10.640 --> 38:14.760
An angel would never ever swear
again like that.

38:18.240 --> 38:20.480
By the way, this outfit of yours, Fong,

38:21.520 --> 38:23.560
is very beautiful, don't you think?

38:24.200 --> 38:25.760
But it will be more striking

38:26.240 --> 38:27.760
if you take off your sweater,

38:28.680 --> 38:31.320
and show off your pretty left arm.

38:40.840 --> 38:43.200
The prince protecting his Fong.

38:43.280 --> 38:44.800
It's so romantic.

38:45.760 --> 38:46.880
Right, Tan?

38:59.760 --> 39:01.480
Why are you so quiet?

39:02.240 --> 39:04.240
Tan, don't you want to talk to me anymore?

39:09.920 --> 39:12.000
[giggles]
Yes, Tan, yes.

39:13.920 --> 39:16.760
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

39:19.960 --> 39:21.200
[Bell] It's so big.

